    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/21c5f1e03098c739048bd2a769e97340-Screenshot 2026-04-14 at 5.17.41 PM.png",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Import your flowchart from your **Backpack** into your project, then add it as context to the AI.\r\n\r\n2. Ask the AI to write the code to implement the logic in the flowchart.\r\n\r\n2. Check that the code matches your flowchart:\r\n\r\n    - **Yes path:** heart turns black and the count increases by 1\r\n    - **No path:** heart resets and the count decreases by 1\r\n\r\n3. If something is incorrect, explain what the AI got wrong and ask it to fix the code.\r\n"
  },
